# The human list of direct dependencies. requirements.txt is generated from it, with every
# release file hash, and the API image installs that file with --require-hashes. Regenerate with
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras --output-file=requirements.txt requirements.in
# using pip-tools in a throwaway virtual environment outside this repository (never in venv/ and
# never in the image). Keep the versions already in requirements.txt unless you mean to upgrade.
#
# Audit (phase 8, 2026-11-11): every pin below is imported by non-test code or run by the
# Dockerfile (uvicorn is the CMD; huggingface_hub is the model download RUN). httpx2 and httpcore2
# are not listed here: they are required by anthropic 1.4.0, openai 3.11.0 and mcp 2.3.0 (kept as
# dependencies, maintained by Pydantic). Nothing was removed.
#
# PyJWT and cryptography are imported directly by broker_engine/auth.py and scripts/mint_token.py
